## Notes for whoever fills this out (delete this section before publishing)

- Keep SKILL.md under ~500 lines. If it's getting long, split detail into
  `references/` and point to it from here rather than inlining everything.
- Pair every SKILL.md with a `README.md` in the same folder — see
  `templates/readme-template.md`.
- Run all three testing layers from `../TESTING.md` before marking this
  skill ready to publish: trigger test, dry run on real input, cold read.
- Add at least one real example output to `examples/` before publishing —
  per the parent task, "if no real output can be produced, the skill is not
  ready to publish."
